    "chunk_text": "Petrus, se apostol, h\u00e6fde wif and cild; and we eac secga\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he swa h\u00e6fde and We ne magan eow neadian, ac we myngia\u00f0 eow, \u00fe\u00e6t ge cl\u00e6nnysse healdan, swaswa Cristes \u00feegenas on Be swylcum witegode se witega Isaisas, \u00feus cwe\u00feende: Ego nunc his, qui custodierint sabbata mea et Be \u00feisum ylcan cw\u00e6\u00f0 Crist on his godspelle: Sunt eunuchi qui se castrauerunt propter regnum c\u00eblorum; Ac Crist cw\u00e6\u00f0 swa\u00feeah, swaswa her cwy\u00f0 on leden, \u00fe\u00e6t synd sume men, ge wel manega syndon, \u00fee Hi habba\u00f0 hira lima and libba\u00f0 on cl\u00e6nnysse. Hi ne beo\u00f0 na forcorfene, ac Gode gecorene. \u00de\u00e6t synd w\u00e6pmen and wifmen, \u00fee wunia\u00f0 on cl\u00e6nnysse. And hi sylfe offria\u00f0 eall Gode on s\u00e6gdnysse, ge on sawle ge on lichama. And hi sceolon habban \u00fea selran wununge binnan Godes weallum and \u00feone ecean naman on his huse Ne \u00feurfan we us ondr\u00e6dan \u00fea deoflican costnunga. Ne magon hig us derian, gif hi us ne licya\u00f0. Swa mycel bi\u00f0 seo synn, \u00fee man sylfwilles de\u00f0, swa mycel yfel hit bi\u00f0. \u00de\u00e6t us ne m\u00e6g derigan, gif us hw\u00e6t un\u00feances of \u00feam deofle be cym\u00f0 \u00feurh nis searo cr\u00e6ftas, slapende Seofan hadas syndan gesette on bocum to Godes \u00feenungum into Godes ciricean. An is hostiarius, o\u00feer is lector, \u00feridda Exorcista, feor\u00fea acolitus, fifta subdiaconus, sixta diacon",
